== Overview ==
'''Infected Titan Speakerman''' is an enemy that only appears in [[Nightmare Mode]] and [[Endless Mode]]. It has a high amount of health and has a special ability where it can shoot at [[units]] to stun them. It is an enemy version of its unit counterpart, {{Legendary|[[Titan Speakerman]]}}.
== Appearance ==
The '''Infected Titan Speakerman''' looks like the old version of {{Legendary|[[Titan Speakerman]]}} but with blue lighting particles around its head and speakers because it is infected. As it is the old version of Titan Speakerman, it has a white suit, unlike the current {{Legendary|[[Titan Speakerman]]}}, which has a red suit instead of a white one.

