== Strategy ==
* The '''Infected Titan Speakerman''' can stun units. This might not be much of a problem, but if you have too little units, all of your units will be stunned. 
*You can use {{Epic|[[Medic Cameraman]]}}, {{Exclusive|[[Speaker Repair Drone]]}} or {{Exclusive|[[Camera Repair Drone]]}} to unstun your units.
* '''Infected Titan Speakerman''' has a lot of health, so you should use high DPS units to take this down such as {{Mythic|[[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]]}}.
* {{Mythic|[[Upgraded Titan Speakerman]]}} can block two stuns from the Infected Titan Speakerman, making it very useful for protecting your higher DPS units.

* {{Mythic|[[Sinister Titan TV Man]]}}, {{Legendary|[[Mech Cameraman]]}}, Levels 5/6 {{Mythic|[[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]]}}, {{Exclusive|[[Astro Upgraded Titan Cameraman]]}} and {{Exclusive|[[TV Woman]]}} can be used to slow this enemy down, making it easier to defeat.

* Any type of movable unit cannot be stunned by this enemy, making units such as {{Exclusive|[[Spider TV]]}} and {{Exclusive|[[Upgraded Camera Spider]]}} more useful against this enemy.
* {{Mythic|[[Upgraded Titan Cameraman]]}} can block 1 stun at Levels 4+ making it useful to protect other units along doing high DPS and slowing down with AoE.

