== Trivia ==
* It is based off of the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Infected_Titan_Speakerman Infected Titan Speakerman] from the series.
* In the game, he has a white suit, but in the series, he has red clothes.
* In the game, He is the same size as [[Camera Helicopter|Mini Titan Cameraman]] but moves slower and has a different ability.
* This is the only [[Enemies|enemy]] in the game that is infected, and is a unit in the game.
* [[Infected Titan Speakerman]] only appears in Nightmare Mode.
* The uninfected form of him is {{Legendary|[[Titan Speakerman]]}}, and his upgraded form is {{Mythic|[[Upgraded Titan Speakerman]]}}.
*The character is the {{Legendary|[[Titan Speakerman]]}}'s old version right after the release.

